      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONNIES CAULDRON (1) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 390m behind Eternal Wish (22.74) in a Grade 6. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Looks the one to beat on her best form. OVERSHADOW GUNN (8) ran a nice race two back to fill a minor placing then got off the mark last time (19.58) at Q Straight over 350m. Will break from a wide draw. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. MICK'S AMY (2) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Maiden at Q Straight. Rates a winning chance on best. DARK EMPRESS (3) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
